# These files are UTF-8 with LF line endings, and the specification's own checker
# reads them as bytes. Normalising line endings here rather than relying on each
# contributor's core.autocrlf keeps a rewrite from turning into a whole-file diff,
# and keeps the non-ASCII punctuation in the documents intact.
* text=auto eol=lf

# The licence text is not ours to reflow.
LICENSE -text
